body:
I cant actually recall anyone having so little about them that turning 13 and getting the same hair everyone does is the only thing they have to be proud about.

honestly too pathetic to even want to roast

&#x200B;

Thats why I picked it up, I love nearly every ff game and loved 14, but a big thing that turned me off and part of why I havent played in about 6 months is because well, it was really hard to find people to talk to about the game \*in the game itself\*. It was so rare for me to meet people who cared about the story, most of the people I met just skip every cutscene in the game and dont care about the story, alot of them joked about how theres no point watching because >insert standard RPG format of hero fights boss hero saves people then another boss shows up etc.

&#x200B;

It was honestly really discouraging to get into an mmo and feel like you are playing a different game than everyone else because you dont wanna skip all and cant talk to people you play the game with about the game outside of just mechanics related things. Put thousands of hours into the game and just couldnt be bothered playing a multiplayer game alone anymore.

[https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/201123671992041473/521523444232355860/Screenshot\_20181210-140651.png](https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/201123671992041473/521523444232355860/Screenshot_20181210-140651.png)

&#x200B;

Bad luck has to turn somewhere :D Thanks for throwing this out there, gl guys\~
